   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISC301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 19 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11706 · Decision 765/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 29/07/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISC301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>19 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11706 · QĐ 765/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 29/07/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Defne all types of e-commerce systems and describe their major business and revenue models, drivers, and benefts.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Describe all the major mechanisms that are used in executing e-commerce.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Describe all methods and models of selling products and services online from business to individual customers.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Understand all online business-to-business activities, including selling, procurement, auctions, and collaboration.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Describe EC activities other than selling online, such as e-government, e-learning/e-- training, e-health, and sharing economy.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Describe the major applications of artifcial intelligence in EC.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Describe social networks, social customers, and social software as facilitators of social commerce.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Describe the landscape of social commerce applications, including social shopping and advertising, social CRM, social entertainment, and crowdsourcing.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Describe social commerce</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Describe the connected e-commerce and Internet of things and its smart applications.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td><strong>CLO11</strong></td><td>Understand online consumer behavior.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td><strong>CLO12</strong></td><td>Describe marketing and advertising in the Web environment.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td><strong>CLO13</strong></td><td>Describe the use of e-payments, including mobile payments, and digital currency in e-commerce.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>14</td><td><strong>CLO14</strong></td><td>Understand order fulfllment in e-commerce and its relationship to supply chain management.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>15</td><td><strong>CLO15</strong></td><td>Understand e-commerce strategy and describe its process and steps, including justifcation, planning, implementation, and assessment.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>16</td><td><strong>CLO16</strong></td><td>Describe the global aspects of e-commerce.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>17</td><td><strong>CLO17</strong></td><td>Explain the issues of using e-commerce by small- and medium-sized companies.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>18</td><td><strong>CLO18</strong></td><td>Understand the ethical, legal, social, and business environments within which e-commerce operates.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>19</td><td><strong>CLO19</strong></td><td>Understand how to Launch a Successful Online Business and EC Projects</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11706</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11706</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
